Extract confirmed patterns into reusable activities.

**Input**: Read `/tmp/meta-learning-{{sessionId}}/META_TEST_RESULTS.md`

**Your Task**: For each confirmed pattern (confidence > 0.7):
1. Create an activity template that embodies the pattern
2. Add validators that prevent identified failure modes
3. Include metadata about the evidence

**Pattern → Activity Transformation**:

**Pattern**: "Redis-based rate limiting has 92% success rate"

**Extract to Activity**:
```json
{
  "id": "add-rate-limiting-redis",
  "name": "Add Redis-Based Rate Limiting",
  "description": "Implement rate limiting using Redis (proven 92% success rate)",
  "execution_type": "template",
  "metadata": {
    "extracted_from": "execution_pattern_analysis",
    "evidence": {
      "success_rate": 0.92,
      "sample_size": 25,
      "confidence": 0.85,
      "learned_at": "{{timestamp}}"
    }
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "verify-package-json",
      "description": "Verify package.json exists (prevents 80% of failures)",
      "validation": {
        "required_files": ["package.json"],
        "reason": "Learned from failure analysis: missing package.json causes failures"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "add-redis-dependency",
      "description": "Add Redis client to dependencies",
      "validation": {
        "required_patterns": ["ioredis|redis|@upstash/redis"],
        "reason": "Pattern from successful executions"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "implement-rate-limiter",
      "description": "Implement rate limiting using Redis INCR/EXPIRE pattern",
      "validation": {
        "required_patterns": ["redis.incr", "redis.expire"],
        "forbidden_patterns": ["Map<", "in-memory"],
        "reason": "Learned: Redis pattern more reliable than in-memory"
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

**Anti-Pattern → Validator**:

**Anti-Pattern**: "Activities fail 80% of the time when package.json is missing"

**Add Validator**:
```json
{
  "preChecks": [
    {
      "name": "verify-package-json-exists",
      "command": "test -f package.json",
      "failureMessage": "package.json not found. This causes 80% of dependency-related failures.",
      "learned_from": "failure_pattern_analysis"
    }
  ]
}
```

**Output**: Create `/tmp/meta-learning-{{sessionId}}/extracted_activities.json` and `/tmp/meta-learning-{{sessionId}}/LEARNING_SUMMARY.md`

